thub.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104533#issuecomment-2761606219","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104533","id":2761606219,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kmsRL","user":{"login":"leandro-benedet-garcia","id":291051,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTA1MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/291051?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia","html_url":"https://github.com/leandro-benedet-garcia","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-28T14:55:23Z","updated_at":"2025-03-28T14:55:23Z","body":"> I wonder if this kind of notice could be automatically added in the future. We should be able to query whether the class is abstract from ClassDB, add this information as an attribute in the class reference XML (so `make_rst.py` can make use of it) and add the paragraph at the end of the description automatically.\r\n\r\nThat would be an excellent idea.\r\n\r\nI think we would just need to check if there's any public constructors available, if not enforce a xml tag that tells how to get the instance, even if it would be a static factory function in the class.\r\n\r\nBut should we pivot this PR to that, create a proposal and close this PR or merge this one and then create the proposal?\r\n\r\nI would prefer the third option because the sooner we have a note, the less we might have people getting confused too.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2761606219/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2943796097","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104533#issuecomment-2943796097","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104533","id":2943796097,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6vdsOB","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-05T11:21:57Z","updated_at":"2025-06-05T11:21:57Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2943796097/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"c